481|## Render to Texture
482|
483|```javascript
484|// Create render target
485|const renderTarget = new THREE.WebGLRenderTarget(512, 512);
486|
487|// Render scene to target
488|renderer.setRenderTarget(renderTarget);
489|renderer.render(scene, camera);
490|renderer.setRenderTarget(null);
491|
492|// Use texture
493|const texture = renderTarget.texture;
494|otherMaterial.map = texture;
495|```
496|
497|## Multi-Pass Rendering
498|
499|```javascript
500|// Multiple composers for different scenes/layers
